{"nodes": [{"id": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified", "label": "Verified: Drizzle + Supabase RLS API surface", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "1-100", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verified 2026-08-24 against the installed packages, not docs or memory, because the schema work was blocked on an unverified API surface."}, {"id": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_pgpolicy", "label": "pgPolicy(name, config)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "14-34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Confirmed from drizzle-orm/pg-core/policies.d.ts: PgPolicyConfig is { as?: 'permissive'|'restrictive'; for?: 'all'|'select'|'insert'|'update'|'delete'; to?: PgPolicyToOption; using?: SQL; withCheck?: SQL }. Policies are hand-written with pgPolicy; if one cannot be expressed, a raw SQL migration is acceptable and better than fighting the abstraction."}, {"id": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_pg_policy_to_option", "label": "PgPolicyToOption accepts a PgRole object", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "28-34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'public' | 'current_role' | 'current_user' | 'session_user' | (string & {}) | PgPolicyToOption[] | PgRole \u2014 so imported role constants can be passed to `to` directly without stringifying."}, {"id": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_enable_rls", "label": ".enableRLS()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "36-46", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Confirmed at drizzle-orm/pg-core/table.d.ts:22 as `enableRLS: () => Omit<PgTableWithColumns<T>, 'enableRLS'>`, chained off pgTable(...). Defining any pgPolicy already enables RLS implicitly, so .enableRLS() is for tables that need RLS with NO policies \u2014 exactly right for tables only the service role should touch."}, {"id": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_drizzle_orm_supabase", "label": "drizzle-orm/supabase exports", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "48-62", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "From drizzle-orm/supabase/rls.d.ts: anonRole, authenticatedRole, serviceRole, postgresRole, supabaseAuthAdminRole (all PgRole), authUid (SQL<unknown>), authUsers (PgTable), plus unused realtimeMessages/realtimeTopic. Everything needed is present."}, {"id": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_auth_users", "label": "authUsers \u2014 typed auth.users table", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "60-64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A real win: customers.auth_user_id can reference authUsers.id as a typed Drizzle FK with onDelete: 'cascade' instead of hand-written SQL against auth.users. Columns include id uuid PK, email, phone, emailConfirmedAt, phoneConfirmedAt, lastSignInAt, createdAt, updatedAt."}, {"id": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_auth_uid", "label": "authUid \u2014 prebuilt SQL fragment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "95-97", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "authUid is a prebuilt SQL fragment, but whether it already renders the (select auth.uid()) performance wrapping is still unverified; if not, use sql`(select auth.uid())` directly."}, {"id": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_crud_policy", "label": "crudPolicy is Neon-only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "66-70", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "crudPolicy exists only under drizzle-orm/neon/rls; there is no Supabase equivalent. This was an open question in the plan and the answer is 'not available', so every policy is written explicitly with pgPolicy \u2014 no shortcut."}, {"id": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_entities_roles_provider", "label": "drizzle.config entities.roles.provider = 'supabase'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "72-99", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Confirmed from drizzle-kit/index.d.mts:131-137 as entities?: { roles?: boolean | { provider?: 'supabase'|'neon'|(string&{}); exclude?: string[]; include?: string[] } }. Setting provider: 'supabase' makes drizzle-kit treat Supabase's built-in roles as pre-existing so it does not emit DROP ROLE for them. Goes in the config from the first migration."}, {"id": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_pinned_versions", "label": "Pinned versions drizzle-orm@0.45.2 / drizzle-kit@0.31.10", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "7-12", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Do not use 1.0.0-beta.x. A v1 beta exists and the docs site banners it, but 0.45.2 is stable and its RLS surface is the one confirmed here. The 0.x\u21921.0 boundary is exactly where the RLS surface is most likely to have moved, so pin exactly."}, {"id": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_ingest_role_pgrole", "label": "pgRole('ingest_role') declaration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "92-94", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tenant policies use to: authenticatedRole; the custom ingest_role needs pgRole('ingest_role') declared, or a raw SQL migration if role creation needs attributes drizzle-kit cannot express."}], "edges": [{"source": "planning_phases_phase_1_foundation_ingest_role", "target": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_ingest_role_pgrole", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "92-94", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified", "target": "planning_phases_phase_1_foundation", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "3-5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified", "target": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_pinned_versions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "7-12", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified", "target": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_pgpolicy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "14-34", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified", "target": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_enable_rls", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md", "source_location": "36-46", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified", "target": "planning_research_drizzle_rls_verified_drizzle_orm_supabase", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".planning/research/DRIZZLE-RLS-VERIFIED.md",